msgstr "5. Importing, exporting, and switching NEP models"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:9873
#: 73f4041a230248028df1c4762e959cf6
msgid "5.1 导入"
msgstr "5.1 Import"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:9875
#: 6e372637e3854a20b8aab2a824bf3db7
msgid "`打开文件…`：选择 `xyz` / `extxyz` 等结构文件。"
msgstr "`Open File…`: choose an `xyz` / `extxyz` or other structure file."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:9876
#: c546d362d62c457ba60d46e000071b96
msgid "`打开文件夹…`：选择训练输出目录或 `deepmd/npy` 目录。"
msgstr "`Open Folder…`: choose a training-output or `deepmd/npy` directory."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:9877
#: ac404485c6f94c028d379360959c6a9c
msgid "拖拽：把文件或目录直接拖进窗口；不支持的格式会提示 `不支持的文件格式`。"
msgstr ""
"Drag and drop: drop a file or directory onto the window; unsupported "
"inputs show `unsupported file format`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:9878
#: 77ecebdc3513435ca9db27e2e979c8c7
msgid "已经打开数据时再导入新数据，软件会先确认是否替换。"
msgstr "If data is already open, NepTrainKit asks before replacing it."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:9879
#: 00b52f47883545258d7bc2ce8a718fc3
msgid "加载在后台进行，加载时显示的进度提示可以取消加载。"
msgstr ""
"Loading runs in the background; the progress notification shown while "
"loading can cancel it."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:9881
#: 3445d97fcd694765989dd5e9ad7658e8
