#: 14fd613ca7b342fda22814f22acdf16e
msgid "删除后仍保留的结构，通常就是清洗后的数据集"
msgstr "Structures kept after deletion, usually the cleaned dataset"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:9890
#: c5314d2d2ae443a9ad4aac8abe19cb9f
msgid "括号里的 N 是当前数量；数量为 0 或数据仍在加载时，对应菜单项不可用。"
msgstr ""
"N is the current count. An item is disabled when its count is 0 or while "
"data is still loading."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:9891
#: a285d4edbf8f414cb93eadd7a9218df1
