#: d75972ea71c74e288f7e6b345854d7b4
msgid "5.3 NEP 模型切换（路径栏右侧下拉框）"
msgstr "5.3 Switching NEP models (drop-down at the right of the path bar)"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:9897
#: 7525340e1e484194a1d5acbb496649f5
msgid ""
"可选模型：当前数据目录下文件名包含 `nep` 的 `*.txt` 文件，`nep.txt` 排在最前， 其余按字母顺序；列表末尾还可以选择内置的"
" `nep89` 模型。"
msgstr ""
"Available models: `*.txt` files in the data directory whose names contain"
" `nep`. `nep.txt` comes first and the rest are sorted alphabetically; the"
" bundled `nep89` model can be chosen at the end of the list."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:9899
#: 66f5b7708c20403e9e41c4ebcc2f61c0
msgid "切换速度：切回已经计算过的模型时直接使用缓存结果；第一次切换到某个模型时会在后台重新计算。"
msgstr ""
"Speed: switching back to a model that has already been evaluated reuses "
"cached results; the first switch to a model recomputes in the background."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:9900
#: aa95ebc7f0b44efcb368ca8ebc471683
msgid "切换后保留当前的选中结构和坏点标记。"
msgstr "The current selection and bad-structure marks are kept after switching."

